<title>FRANCE: EU raises daily wheat export refund to Switzerland.</title>
<headline>EU raises daily wheat export refund to Switzerland.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union has raised the daily refund applying to soft wheat exports to Switzerland to 9.50 Ecus per tonne from a previous level of eight Ecus, France's grain office ONIC said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The refund on barley exports to Switzerland was lowered to 21.00 Ecus per tonne from 21.50 Ecus. --Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
